Scope

The MIT licence above covers the code in this repository: the analysis and
extraction tools, the recompilation runtime, the rebuilt entity and weapon
code, the build files, and the documentation.

It does NOT and cannot cover Gunman Chronicles itself, nor the GoldSrc engine
it runs on. No game binaries and no game assets are distributed here, and you
need your own copy of the game to use any of this.

Gunman Chronicles is the property of its respective owners; the rights have sat
between Valve and the Activision Blizzard estate since Sierra was wound down,
which is why the game cannot be bought anywhere. This project is not affiliated
with or endorsed by any of them.
